@startuml
title 继续仿真用例时序图

actor 用户 as USER
participant "WEBUI\n(Vue3 页面)" as WEBUI
participant "JsApi\n(fsSimApi.js /\nstore / mqttClient)" as JSApi
participant "Controller\n(SimController)" as CTRL
participant "Service\n(McpClientService)" as SVC
participant "FS\n(MCP Server\n仿真引擎)" as FS
participant "DB\n(mysql\nfs_model_file)" as DB

USER -> WEBUI : 1. 点击"继续"按钮\n（btn1Click -> doResume）
WEBUI -> JSApi : 2. fsSimResumeModel\n({id, modelId})
JSApi -> CTRL : 3. POST\n/fscloud/sim/resumeModel
CTRL -> SVC : 4. mcpClientService\n.resumeSimulation(...)
SVC -> FS : 5. MCP tools/call\nresumeRemoteSimulation
FS --> SVC : 6. 返回 status=RUNNING
SVC --> CTRL : 7. 业务 JSON
CTRL -> DB : 8. 更新 sim_status\n（trackingMap）
CTRL --> JSApi : 9. RunModelDto\n（status=RUNNING）
JSApi -> JSApi : 10. store 更新\n仿真状态
JSApi --> WEBUI : 11. 状态卡片显示\n"运行中"
WEBUI --> USER : 12. btn1Text 变为\n"暂停"

@enduml
